obj=User~User ACTOR
obj=TransactionsView~TV
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=TransactionService~TS
obj=CsvImporter~CI
obj=BankCsvAdapter~AD
obj=Categorizer~CAT
obj=TransactionRepository~TR
obj=BudgetService~BS
obj=GoalService~GS

User: Part A - import a CSV file
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;TV: choose CSV file, click Import
TV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: importTransactions(file)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;TS: importFile(file)
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CI: parse(file)
CI-&gt;&gt;&gt;CI +1: detectAdapter(header)
combinedFragment=alt~cf1 User GS; User: [no adapter recognises the header, or file unreadable]
CI.&gt;TS: throw UnsupportedFormatException
TS.&gt;F: throw TransactionImportException
F.&gt;TV: error message
TV.&gt;User: show supported layouts, nothing saved
..=cf1; User: [adapter found]
CI-&gt;&gt;&gt;AD: readTransactions()
combinedFragment=loop~cf2 AD CAT; AD: [each record read from the CSVParser (adaptee)]
AD-&gt;&gt;&gt;AD +1: toTransaction(row)
--=cf2
AD: an InvalidRowException rejects only that row
AD.&gt;CI: ParseResult (transactions, rejected rows)
CI.&gt;TS: ParseResult
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;TS +1: removeDuplicates(transactions)
combinedFragment=loop~cf3 TS CAT; TS:[each new transaction]
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CAT: categorize(tx)
CAT.&gt;TS: Category (see SD02)
--=cf3
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;TR: saveAll(transactions)
TS.&gt;F: ImportResult (imported, duplicates, rejected)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS: refreshAlerts(affected months)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: evaluateAll()
F.&gt;TV: ImportResult
TV.&gt;User: import summary
--=cf1
User: Part B - add a single transaction by hand
User-&gt;&gt;&gt;TV: fill in the Add Transaction form, click Save
TV-&gt;&gt;&gt;F: addTransaction(entry)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;TS: addTransaction(entry)
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;TS +1: validate(entry)
combinedFragment=alt~cf4 User GS; User: [zero amount, empty merchant or future date]
TS.&gt;F: throw ValidationException
F.&gt;TV: error message
TV.&gt;User: show the validation error
..=cf4; User: [entry valid]
combinedFragment=opt~cf5 TS CAT; TS: [no category chosen]
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CAT: categorize(tx)
CAT.&gt;TS: Category
--=cf5
TS-&gt;&gt;&gt;TR: saveAll(list of one Transaction)
TS.&gt;F: Transaction
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS: refreshAlerts(affected month)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS: evaluateAll()
F.&gt;TV: Transaction
TV.&gt;User: row added
--=cf4</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element></diagram>